{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20937","headline":"谢秀才有妾缟练改从於人秀才留之不得[後]生感忆座人制诗嘲谢贺复继四首 三 · 李贺","name":"谢秀才有妾缟练改从於人秀才留之不得[後]生感忆座人制诗嘲谢贺复继四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞房思不禁，蜂子作花心。\n灰暖残香炷，发冷青虫簪。\n夜遥灯焰短，睡熟小屏深。\n好作鸳鸯梦，南城罢捣碪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}